timeline.body:
You are not using this builder properly:
- `simpleCache` is a required parameter... put it in the builder constructor then, along with other required parameters
- Sometimes you call `setUpstreamDataSourceFactory` before calling `build`, sometimes you don't call it (which means the last set one is used)

I would remove the builder completely and just use this method in `PlayerDataSource`:
```java
CacheFactory buildCacheFactory(@Nullable final DataSource.Factory upstreamDataSourceFactory) {
    return new CacheFactory(context, userAgent, transferListener, cache, upstreamDataSourceFactory);
}
```

Also, it feels really strange to have a `Builder` for a `Factory` but anyway ;-)

